comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T16:46:58.595Z",codex-agent,"Audit plan: replace index.ts custom schema discovery with readSettingsWithMetadata and resolveRuntimeFieldRegistry, deleting the manual JSON reader/merge. Link prior SDK adoption pm-csv-axm5 and persistence prerequisite pm-csv-sdk-write-fence. SDK canonical field ordering, normalized tokens, last-definition precedence and invalid settings validation are intentional documented differences; preserve the optional-discovery empty-list fallback. Evidence will include real public tracker differential copies, per-replacement behavioral revert, targeted tests and full npm/Bun release gates."
  "2026-10-25T16:46:59.745Z",codex-agent,"Not replaced: atomic-update.ts captureUpdateCompensation and roundtrip.ts snapshot/applyPlan. Pinned SDK 2026.10.20 mutateItem has no lease-owner/revision persistence fence; peer host floor is 2026.8.20. Existing guardEditMutation/assertEditLease must remain until pm-csv-sdk-write-fence (gh:unbraind/pm-cli#1549) is resolved. Missing SDK API: verified read-only item+history snapshot under one lease, and atomic lease/revision fencing with compatibility for extension-owned locks. commitItemMutations update match exists but validates only one field/key, cannot express the multi-field three-way conflict predicate or verified history prefix plus exact raw-representation compensation, and restore-by-updated_at would lose these guarantees. Missing SDK API: async under-lock verified-history precondition and exact snapshot/representation compensation hook. No dependency bump, cache substitution or removal of existing verification."
  "2026-10-25T16:57:11.710Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: restored only discoverCustomFields from origin/main (7b609b1), leaving async callers and regression tests intact. node --test --test-name-pattern=\"SDK discovery uses canonical\" test/sdk-adoption.test.ts failed 1/1: legacy code returned literal Zeta/OLD instead of canonical alpha/severity and zeta/new. Restored SDK implementation passes 4/4 adoption regressions. This is the sole replaced implementation; atomic-update.ts and roundtrip.ts remain unchanged for the separately documented missing SDK guarantees."
  "2026-10-25T16:57:13.372Z",codex-agent,"Compatibility: verified the real published minimum SDK 2026.8.20 has readSettingsWithMetadata and resolveRuntimeFieldRegistry but lacks runWithConfigurationOnlySettings/loadGuardedRuntimeSchema. Final implementation uses only the two common SDK APIs; no peer floor or dependency pin change. SDK settings reads can initialize missing schema files, documented in README; complete initialized schemas are byte-preserved in a no-git regression. Packed npm-current, Bun-current and npm-minimum scenarios now exercise --all-fields. Existing history verification and callback lease guards are unchanged; a regression primes listMutationEvents derived_index, corrupts history, and proves checkout/apply/capture/compensation reject without writes."
  "2026-10-25T16:57:15.067Z",codex-agent,"Differential receipt: origin/main build 7b609b1 versus SDK implementation on read-only authoritative copies of public unbraind/pm-csv@7b609b1 and unbraind/pm-vcs@c7790d4, outside git. 26/26 identical observations (discovery helper plus six command and six exporter options per tracker); all 589 archived authoritative files unchanged. test/repros/sdk-adoption-differential.ts rebuilds the baseline, verifies public repository visibility, dispatches real commands/exporters, and checks source hashes. Intentional SDK-only normalization, ordering, file override precedence, additional file shapes, settings fallback and schema bootstrap are documented and covered by synthetic real-tracker regressions."
  "2026-10-25T17:05:32.766Z",codex-agent,"CI first pass ran 335/335 tests successfully on Node 22 and 26 but correctly refused 99.96% lines / 99.92% branches because the SDK already absorbs settings read errors, leaving a redundant local catch unexercised. Removed that redundant fallback and replaced the read-hook fixture with a real settings filesystem error that asserts the SDK warning/fallback. Thresholds unchanged. Full gates will be rerun; initial CI failure is not passing evidence."
